## Note on the IJG-derived code

The `transupp.c` transform engine originates from the IJG libjpeg distribution,
where it is copyright (C) 1991-2026, Thomas G. Lane, Guido Vollbeding, under the
same IJG terms as above.

## Other bundled material

  - Emscripten 6.0.9 is used as the build toolchain (system package, not
    vendored). It is licensed under the MIT/University of Illinois license.
  - `test/fixtures/lenna.jpg` is the classical Lenna test image, used here only
    as a sample photograph for the smoke test. Its copyright is not held by
    this project and it is covered by neither license above; it is included for
    testing purposes only.
